#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:5
#: 9fabe901104c44a9bf07484b8b0d4bbd
msgid "Wiki Editing - Archiving and Deleting"
msgstr "Wiki 编辑 - 归档与删除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:7
#: c71587329eb74921a8be4ec0fef6198b
msgid ""
"Topics that are no longer relevant for current products, but which may be "
"useful for some existing users, should be archived."
msgstr "对于当前产品已不再适用但对部分现有用户仍有参考价值的主题，应予以归档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:9
#: c61410b90d0a4a579e7b1cb73b75fd73
msgid "This is done by:"
msgstr "操作方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:11
#: c46f3a48da424e1c947e7e1bdb821d34
msgid "Add \"Archived:\" prefix to the page title:"
msgstr "在页面标题前添加「Archived:」前缀："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:19
#: a0ecfdd4872e4f779830629d42ec3707
msgid ""
"Add a warning directive with a note below the title, explaining that the "
"article is archived. If possible, provide additional information about why "
"it has been archived, and links to alternative/more up-to-date information:"
msgstr "在标题下方添加 warning 指令和说明，解释文章已归档。如可能，请提供归档原因以及替代/更新资料的链接："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:29
#: 0e76897ea581412b9952702a3a9a00b3
msgid ""
"Move the topic under \"Archived Topics\" in the menu (you will need to edit "
"the toctree directive in :ref:`common-archived-topics`)."
msgstr ""
"将主题移至菜单中的「Archived Topics」（需编辑 :ref:`common-archived-topics` 中的 toctree 指令）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:34
#: b09c25f5f1e24c0091921f86bf6624d0
msgid "Deleting wiki pages"
msgstr "删除 Wiki 页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:36
#: c219eb4ba1cc42339a703a86d023c394
msgid ""
"Wiki pages can be deleted by removing them from github and any menu in which"
" they appear."
msgstr "Wiki 页面可通过从 GitHub 及所有出现它的菜单中删除来完成删除。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-archiving.rst:40
#: 43971e146c4d431abc2d6eba80832f03
msgid ""
"Before deleting a wiki page it is important to ensure that it is not the "
"parent of other menu items (e.g. it does not contain a \"toctree\")"
msgstr "删除 wiki 页面前，务必确认该页面不是其他菜单项的父页面（即不包含「toctree」）"
